.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-status 1  "oct-status " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-status \- Show information about the data on a card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct status\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-K\fR|\fB\-\-public\-key\-material\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Show information about the data on a card
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Use verbose output
.TP
\fB\-K\fR, \fB\-\-public\-key\-material\fR
Print public key material for each key slot
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
